{"id":"n28096-1-9","stage":5,"title":"가누다 · 支撑","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28096-1-9-1","ko":"아이가 목을 가누기 시작했어요?","zh":"宝宝开始能抬头了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"목을","meaning":"脖子，颈","explanation":"목：脖子，颈；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"1","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목을","audio":"/audio/d5e13c532200d2f0453d.mp3"}},{"text":"가누기","meaning":"支撑，挺","explanation":"가누다：支撑，挺；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"가누다","audio":"/audio/e28760da15e984c4c8e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28096","senseId":"1","lemma":"가누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가누기","audio":"/audio/e1d09dcc63a7214b8fb1.mp3"}},{"text":"시작했어요?","meaning":"开始","explanation":"시작하다：开始；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"시작하다","audio":"/audio/93e3308b9dd20149a4c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66567","senseId":"1","lemma":"시작하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시작했어요","audio":"/audio/fc5f9b5680baf64b3f5e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","term":"목","zh":"脖子，颈","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3","entryId":"89861","definition":"连接人或动物头部和身体的纤细的部分。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"e28760da15e984c4","term":"가누다","zh":"支撑，挺","audio":"/audio/e28760da15e984c4c8e9.mp3","entryId":"28096","definition":"摆正身体或身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["가누다"]},{"id":"93e3308b9dd20149","term":"시작하다","zh":"开始","audio":"/audio/93e3308b9dd20149a4c5.mp3","entryId":"66567","definition":"完成某件事或行为的第一阶段。","pronunciation":["시ː자카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6dd336e35c367ab0a42.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28096-1-9-2","ko":"아니요. 아직은 목에 힘이 없어서 가누지 못해요.","zh":"没有。他还不能控制脖子，所以抬不起来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"아직은","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직은","audio":"/audio/a940dd954642dd9b482d.mp3"}},{"text":"목에","meaning":"脖子，颈","explanation":"목：脖子，颈；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"1","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목에","audio":"/audio/fb59b7ce3500a3bfa3aa.mp3"}},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"力量，力气","explanation":"힘：力量，力气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘이","audio":"/audio/748f97ff6aa7a31c4ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"없어서","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어서","audio":"/audio/adaf4f61a45d9bd6ce5a.mp3"}},{"text":"가누지","meaning":"支撑，挺","explanation":"가누다：支撑，挺；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与